      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Tenant reports that a caller identifying himself as a heating contractor asked her to leave the front-door key in the outside meter cabinet for a possible visit on Wednesday morning, May 14. She has no appointment window and has not agreed to a visit or key arrangement.",
