      "end": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L3",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 09:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **To:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 51,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L5",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 09:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "Tenant says the caller gave the name Bram Alder and called from 07700 900683. She confirmed the property when asked but did not provide an entry code or other access details.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 289
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L1",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 09:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L2",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 09:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 85
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L3",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 09:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 86,
      "end": 117
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L5",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 09:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Asked whether he had arranged heating work at the property, identified the contractor, or agreed a date or key arrangement.",
      "start": 119,
      "end": 242
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L1",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 10:11:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L2",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 10:11:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L3",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 10:11:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 117
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L5",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 10:11:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Landlord says he asked someone to look into intermittent boiler pressure loss but has not fixed a date or discussed keys or access with the tenant. He cannot confirm the caller's identity from the name provided.",
      "start": 119,
      "end": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L1",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 10:46:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L2",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 10:46:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 51
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L3",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 10:46:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 52,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L5",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 10:46:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Tenant says she will be away during the proposed Wednesday morning period. Her 15-year-old son may return from school while she is out; she does not consider him an access contact and does not want him asked to let anyone in.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 341
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L1",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L2",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L3",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 117
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L5",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Forwards a message from Bram Alder saying he 'might call in Wednesday morning'. It contains no appointment window, work reference, business address, or confirmation that the tenant has agreed access.",
      "start": 119,
      "end": 318
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L1",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 12:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L2",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 12:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 85
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L3",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 12:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Bram Alder (Contractor, Hearthline Boiler Service)",
      "start": 86,
      "end": 146
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L5",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 12:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Requested confirmation of his current business identity and contact details, the work he understands he has been asked to perform, and the proposed visit time. Asked whether he had requested that the tenant leave a key in the meter cabinet.",
      "start": 148,
      "end": 388
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L1",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 13:16:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bram Alder (Contractor, Hearthline Boiler Service)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L2",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 13:16:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bram Alder (Contractor, Hearthline Boiler Service)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Bram Alder (Contractor, Hearthline Boiler Service)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L3",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 13:16:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bram Alder (Contractor, Hearthline Boiler Service)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 146
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L5",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 13:16:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bram Alder (Contractor, Hearthline Boiler Service)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Says he understood Orren Vale wanted him to 'check the boiler' and that Wednesday morning might suit. Says the meter-cabinet key request was intended to avoid a wasted journey. His reply includes no work reference or business address.",
      "start": 148,
      "end": 382
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L1",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 14:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
