      "end": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L2",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 14:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **From:** Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L3",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 14:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **To:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L5",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 14:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Tenant says the meter cabinet is outside and shared with neighboring homes. She asks whether a visit has actually been arranged and says she has no appointment details.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 286
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L1",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 15:18:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L2",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 15:18:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L3",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 15:18:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 117
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L5",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-12 15:18:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Landlord says Bram Alder has previously done work for him at another property, but he has not checked the contractor's current business details or insurance. He wants the pressure issue investigated but has not specified a date.",
      "start": 119,
      "end": 347
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L1",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 08:03:00 UTC",
