      "id": "013:L5",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 08:29:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Maintenance enquiry NBL-029-01 remains open. Correspondence logged: landlord email of 12 May at 10:11 and contractor call of 13 May at 08:03. Work-order appointment entry: EMPTY. External key-drop authorisation field: EMPTY.",
      "start": 135,
      "end": 359
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L1",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 10:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L2",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 10:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L3",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 10:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 117
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L5",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 10:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Orren Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Landlord authorizes a diagnostic visit by a suitably identified heating contractor to investigate intermittent pressure loss. He does not confirm that Bram Alder is currently engaged by Hearthline Boiler Service and has not agreed entry while the tenant is absent or an external key arrangement.",
      "start": 119,
      "end": 414
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L1",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 11:41:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Portal",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L2",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 11:41:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **From:** Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L3",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 11:41:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **To:** Tamsin Rook (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L5",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 11:41:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Vey (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Tenant reports the heating is currently working, although boiler pressure has dropped intermittently during the past month. She could be home Saturday, May 17, between 10:00 and 12:00 if the visitor and purpose are confirmed in advance.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 354
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L1",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 12:26:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bram Alder (Contractor, Hearthline Boiler Service)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L2",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-13 12:26:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Bram Alder (Contractor, Hearthline Boiler Service)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Bram Alder (Contractor, Hearthline Boiler Service)",
